  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/06/IMG_8874.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>20 fotos. Antes, junto a los bomberos forestales, hab&iacute;an intervenido en <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/nadal.escrig/posts/10215791354318081\" target=\"_blank\">un peque&ntilde;o incendio entre el Cam&iacute; l&#39;Aguillador y la calle Ingeniero Echegaray, cerca de viviendas</a>. Hacia la medianoche han tenido que actuar tambi&eacute;n en un peue&ntilde;o fuego junto a la pista deportiva de Monteblanco.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendifurgonetanoustil/img_8862.jpg\" alt=\"img_8862\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendifurgonetanoustil/img_8863.jpg\" alt=\"img_8863\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendifurgonetanoustil/img_8864.jpg\" alt=\"img_8864\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendifurgonetanoustil/img_8865.jpg\" alt=\"img_8865\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendifurgonetanoustil/img_8867.jpg\" alt=\"img_8867\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendifurgonetanoustil/img_8868.jpg\" alt=\"img_8868\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendifurgonetanoustil/img_8869.jpg\" alt=\"img_8869\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendifurgonetanoustil/img_8870.jpg\" alt=\"img_8870\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb